<title>SWEDEN: Iceland airport cargo volumes rise 28 pct March.</title>
<headline>Iceland airport cargo volumes rise 28 pct March.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iceland's international airport at Keflavik handled 2,535 tonnes of freight in March this year, a 28 percent rise from the same month in 1996, Iceland's civil aviation administration said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity for the month.</p>
<p>				     March '97	   March '96</p>
<p> Cargo: export (in tonnes)     1,568		  1,359</p>
<p>	  import			 967		    628</p>
<p> TOTAL				 2,535		  1,987</p>
<p> Mail: export			   48		     45</p>
<p>	 import			  118		    126</p>
<p> TOTAL				   166		    171</p>
<p> Passengers			 70,709		 60,853</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1045</p>
</text>
